      "message": "Good point. I\u0027ve updated the code.\nThe expected behavior has been updated as follows:\n\n1. Page-Scoped Selection: The header \"Select All\" checkbox is strictly limited to rows visible on the current page slice (startIndex to endIndex based on currentPage and perPage), preventing off-page or filtered-out rows from being selected. Navigating between pages resets the selection, while changing items-per-page preserves existing selections and updates the header checkbox state, matching master.\n2. Current Session Exclusion: The active logged-in session is excluded from the header \"Select All\" action and filtered out of bulk disconnect payloads, preventing accidental self-termination.",
